  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1742937573_2124538_3e91dbd46c1e7f67fdc8629921b5e0c0.png",
  "description": "<h4 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"139\" data-start=\"109\"><strong data-end=\"137\" data-start=\"114\">Brand Introduction:</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"440\" data-start=\"140\">Pores is a New Zealand-based skincare brand focused on simplicity, sustainability, and suitability for the local environment. Our mission is to provide high-quality, effective skincare solutions designed specifically for New Zealand&rsquo;s climate, using clean ingredients and eco-friendly packaging.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"473\" data-start=\"442\"><strong data-end=\"471\" data-start=\"447\">Product Description:</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"746\" data-start=\"474\">Our skincare range includes serums that target key skin concerns while maintaining a minimalist and effective approach. Currently, our Vitamin C and Niacinamide serums retail for $45, formulated to brighten, hydrate, and protect the skin.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"786\" data-start=\"748\"><strong data-end=\"784\" data-start=\"753\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h4>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1024\" data-start=\"787\">\r\n<li data-end=\"852\" data-start=\"787\">\r\n<p data-end=\"852\" data-start=\"789\"><strong data-end=\"799\" data-start=\"789\">Simple</strong>: No unnecessary additives&mdash;just effective skincare.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"853\">\r\n<p data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"855\"><strong data-end=\"870\" data-start=\"855\">Sustainable</strong>: Eco-friendly packaging and responsibly sourced ingredients.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1024\" data-start=\"934\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1024\" data-start=\"936\"><strong data-end=\"948\" data-start=\"936\">Suitable</strong>: Formulated for the New Zealand climate, addressing local skincare needs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1051\" data-start=\"1026\"><strong data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1031\">Payment Terms:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"1052\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1100\" data-start=\"1052\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1100\" data-start=\"1054\">Affiliates earn <strong data-end=\"1088\" data-start=\"1070\">10% commission</strong> per sale.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"1101\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1178\" data-start=\"1103\">Customers receive <strong data-end=\"1132\" data-start=\"1121\">15% off</strong> using the affiliate&rsquo;s unique discount code.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"1179\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1286\" data-start=\"1181\">Payments are processed <strong data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1204\">monthly</strong> via [PayPal/Bank Transfer].</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1317\" data-start=\"1288\"><strong data-end=\"1315\" data-start=\"1293\">Other Information:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1656\" data-start=\"1318\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1416\" data-start=\"1318\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1416\" data-start=\"1320\">Open to influencers, skincare enthusiasts, and content creators passionate about clean beauty.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1512\" data-start=\"1417\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1512\" data-start=\"1419\">Marketing materials (banners, product images, and social media templates) will be provided.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
